{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NfktCdzUbi1793791231.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞冠精英盃，希拉爾主場2-0擊敗沙比阿爾阿里。</p><p></p><p>藍衫的希拉爾，靠古列巴利截走對方腳下球，入禁區橫傳屈堅斯，再推橫射入，6分鐘開紀錄。這支沙特球隊兩連勝後，上一輪不敵艾沙瑪，這球原來射中人改變方向。</p><p></p><p>這位英格蘭前鋒，換邊後1分鐘，再接應後隊友的妙傳，無人看管下，射入今場第二球，助攻來自艾斯錫，希拉爾贏阿聯酋對手2-0，四戰三勝一負，排西亞區第二。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T12:05:28.847443+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T11:12:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T13:18:35.663739+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:31.736538+00:00","content_hash":"f9887649be967f27ed723745fa7398337524cd9b9c09d23c5702755ad0e30f33","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}